{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban cameras with AI capability within works vehicles",
        "additional_details": "I am endeavouring to address the deployment of AI-enhanced cameras, as we believe their implementation appears to infringe upon our privacy, which some organisations seem to be overlooking.",
        "background": "Ban the use of cameras with AI capability within any works vehicle. We find this tool to be very intrusive, and are concerned about breaches of data protection laws. Most companies use the argument of driver safety over driver privacy but we disagree.",
